{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And I know that he will not let you go,</b> etc. He revealed to him beforehand that Pharaoh was destined to harden his heart, so that he would not be astonished when he refuses. Now, if when He revealed it to him beforehand he became angry with Him — had He not revealed it to him, all the more so." "<b>And not by a mighty hand.</b> Even though I show him the nine plagues, which were called 'a mighty hand,' as it is written, 'ולכל היד החזקה,' and we say: these are the nine plagues — still he will not let you go. But when I send forth My hand and strike Egypt with the plague of the firstborn, after that he will send you forth."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:56:02.253785032Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}